line	<str>Attempt to mine the cave entrance (do not use your boost yet if you brought one)</str>
line	
line	<str>Climb up the rockslides nearby (boosting to 68 Agility if necessary), and use a rope on the tree.</str>
line	
line	<str>Climb the rope and cross the ledge.</str>
line	
line	<str>Climb the last rockslide and pass the fallen tree.</str>
line	
line	<str>Talk to Boulder.</str>
line	
line	<str>Sneak in via the broken fence just east. Prepare to run past a lot of angry trolls.</str>
line	
line	<str>Go south along the city's edge, then west. Once you reach a small alleyway to the north (see image), recover your run energy if necessary.</str>
line	
line	<str>Run to the bucket spawn and stand there for a moment.</str>
line	
line	<str>Click on the 'little boulder' just north of you, and right before reaching it, click on the hole all the way to the north to climb down.</str>
line	
line	<str>Once descended, quickly go south and pass through the narrow gap. DO NOT climb up the ramp.</str>
line	
line	<str>Empty your hands and swim further into the cave while avoiding the first set of trolls' stones.</str>
line	
line	<str>For the second set of trolls, the final troll will throw rocks, creating stepping stones. When the troll begins throwing, move one tile forward, making a path of 5 stones to the edge of the water. Click one tile toward the cave exit as soon as the throwing animation starts until the path is finished.</str>
line	
line	<str>Mine the cave exit (boosting to 72 Mining if necessary).</str>
line	
line	<str>Talk to Mother.</str>
line	
line	<str>After Snowflake leaves, pick all possible options.</str>
line	
line	<str>Talk to My Arm.</str>
line	
line	<str>Talk to the Wise Old Man in Draynor Village.</str>
line	
line	<str>Build the coffin next to the Wise Old Man.</str>
line	
line	<str>Speak to the Apothecary in Varrock.</str>
line	
line	<str>Talk to the Wise Old Man back in Draynor Village.</str>
line	
line	<str>Take the Old Man's coffin.</str>
line	
line	<str>Return to Weiss by travelling with Larry's boat.</str>
line	
line	<str>Go through the cave entrance.</str>
line	
line	<str>Talk to My Arm by the north entrance.</str>
line	
line	<str>Talk to Odd Mushroom.</str>
line	
line	<col=000080>Talk to Snowflake.</col>
